# neck/man/amulet: the man's amulet: a metal2 pendant on a leather cord at the chest; its gem flashes white on the idle's blink frame
# (keys expr: a glint every few seconds, phased per person like the blink)
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role neck amulet
layer neck
anchor neck
keys expr

